```Title: Browser Password Store Accessed from the Command Line on Windows (raw Sysmon events)```
```ATT&CK: T1555.003 | Severity: medium | Sigma id: ac505869-554d-4365-b832-4d54a209a97f```
```Data source: Sysmon EventCode 1 (Splunk Add-on for Sysmon). Change index to where your Sysmon data lives.```
```False positives: Backup, browser-migration and forensic tools```
```Suggested ES correlation search: cron */15 * * * *, earliest=-20m@m latest=-5m@m, throttle on the table fields, notable severity medium.```
index=sysmon source="XmlWinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=1
(CommandLine IN ("*\\Login Data*", "*\\logins.json*", "*\\key4.db*"))
| table _time host User ParentImage Image CommandLine
